Cell["\<\
On the square grid the sliced cylinder about a column is the rectangle with \
flat ends, and the rounded one adds the half disks.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"0a33dd08-04f4-4efc-b92c-f24ad256cf49"],

